WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.625
In verse 13.21, Lord Krishna explains

2
00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:32.791
how prakriti

3
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.166
and purusha together

4
00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:36.541
create various experiences.

5
00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:39.250
He clarifies that prakriti is the cause of the body,

6
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.291
the senses, and material effects.

7
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:43.250
And the jivatma

8
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.541
is itself the cause of its own joy and sorrow.

9
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.833
Lord Krishna says,

10
00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:57.708
“Karya-karana-kartritva hetu prakriti uchyate”.

11
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.583
Prakriti is responsible for all

12
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:03.916
cause and effect in the material world.

13
00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:06.625
Prakriti creates the body, the senses,

14
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:08.541
and the sense objects

15
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:12.125
that form the basis of all experience,

16
00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:16.000
but prakriti itself is not the experiencer.

17
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.500
It only provides the space where the jivatma

18
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.875
becomes engaged and passes through
various emotions.

19
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:25.291
The changes that occur in the material world

20
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.291
arise from prakriti.

21
00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:29.208
Lord Krishna then says,

22
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:33.833
“Purushah sukha-duhkhanam bhoktritva
hetur uchyate”.

23
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.625
Meaning - The purusha,

24
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.125
is the experiencer of joy and sorrow. The jivatma

25
00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:42.250
wishes to enjoy material nature.

26
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.000
It desires to control it.

27
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.583
For this reason, it identifies with the body

28
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:50.458
and sense experiences.

29
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.083
This mindset of enjoyment

30
00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:53.208
binds the soul to

31
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:56.250
experiences of joy and sorrow.

32
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.000
But

33
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.416
these are only the changes of the material world.

34
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.458
Through prakriti, it is decided,

35
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.666
according to the soul's past karma,

36
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:08.416
which body the soul will receive.

37
00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:10.333
Once the soul enters

38
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:12.541
a particular body,

39
00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:14.375
it is bound to act

40
00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:16.416
according to that body's

41
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:18.250
nature.

42
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:21.000
For example, if a soul enters the body

43
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.708
of a dog,

44
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.333
it must behave like a dog.

45
00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:28.750
And if it enters the body of a deva,

46
00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.750
it behaves accordingly.

47
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.875
The body and its limitations

48
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:34.750
are determined by prakriti.

49
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.500
But the soul's experience of joy and sorrow

50
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.708
arises from its

51
00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:41.291
identification with that body.

52
00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:43.625
Just as a person watching a film

53
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.791
chooses whether to become emotionally

54
00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:47.791
absorbed in the scenes

55
00:02:47.791 --> 00:02:49.208
or to remain detached,

56
00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:52.875
the soul's experiences depend on its attachment

57
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:54.083
or detachment

58
00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:56.833
from the material body.

59
00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:59.041
Lord Krishna emphasises that

60
00:02:59.041 --> 00:03:00.583
the transformations of prakriti

61
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:01.833
are inevitable

62
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:04.750
and beyond the soul's control.

63
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.208
But how much to engage

64
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.541
with prakriti's experiences,

65
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:09.166
this choice

66
00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:13.000
belongs entirely to the jivatma.

67
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.166
Through spiritual knowledge

68
00:03:15.166 --> 00:03:17.000
and devotion,

69
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.791
the soul can develop vairagya, detachment,

70
00:03:18.791 --> 00:03:22.000
rise above the material world, and free itself

71
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.250
from the bondage of joy and sorrow.

72
00:03:29.791 --> 00:03:31.500
Listen,

73
00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:33.750
you cannot control every event

74
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.458
in your life.

75
00:03:36.458 --> 00:03:39.833
Accidents happen, people change,

76
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:43.000
plans fail, and unexpected

77
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.666
situations arise.

78
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:49.291
But here is a powerful

79
00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:52.708
truth to keep in mind,

80
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:56.750
although events are not in your control,

81
00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.791
how you experience them is.

82
00:04:00.791 --> 00:04:05.666
Think of your life like a film.

83
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.916
Once the film begins,

84
00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:12.750
you cannot change the scenes. But

85
00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.750
you can choose

86
00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.416
how deeply they affect you.

87
00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:21.875
Some people weep during the sad parts.

88
00:04:21.875 --> 00:04:26.000
Others remain calm,

89
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.083
because they know

90
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:31.458
it is only a story.

91
00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:32.583
This same principle

92
00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:36.541
applies to your daily life.

93
00:04:36.541 --> 00:04:38.916
Your body, your circumstances,

94
00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:42.708
your environment,

95
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:45.708
these are all provided by prakriti.

96
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:47.875
But your joy or sorrow

97
00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:50.000
does not come from these things.

98
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.166
It comes from

99
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:56.291
the level of your attachment to them.

100
00:04:56.291 --> 00:05:01.458
If you can pause and remind yourself,

101
00:05:01.458 --> 00:05:04.166
'I am the soul

102
00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:07.000
that is watching this,

103
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.333
not the body

104
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:11.916
that is reacting to it,'

105
00:05:11.916 --> 00:05:15.375
you gain a powerful

106
00:05:15.375 --> 00:05:17.041
freedom.

107
00:05:17.041 --> 00:05:19.666
You are then far less disturbed by
success or failure,

108
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:22.833
praise or criticism.

109
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:24.958
So the next time

110
00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:28.750
something does not go your way,

111
00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.500
do not ask,

112
00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.583
'Why is this happening to me?'

113
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:36.916
Ask instead,

114
00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:40.708
'How do I wish to experience this?'

115
00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:44.916
This will not only change your feelings,

116
00:05:44.916 --> 00:05:50.083
it will change the way you live.

117
00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:53.916
You will experience a remarkable freedom,

118
00:05:53.916 --> 00:05:57.583
and remain at peace

119
00:05:57.583 --> 00:05:59.125
whatever the circumstances.

120
00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:06.125
You believe this, don't you,

121
00:06:06.125 --> 00:06:10.583
as a parent or elder of the family,

122
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:12.541
you naturally wish

123
00:06:12.541 --> 00:06:14.000
to give your loved ones

124
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.875
the very best,

125
00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:20.833
good food, a safe home, education, comforts,

126
00:06:20.833 --> 00:06:25.000
and even emotional support.

127
00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:31.000
But understand this deeply,

128
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:35.125
you can provide the arrangement,

129
00:06:35.125 --> 00:06:38.541
but you cannot control how

130
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:40.416
each family member

131
00:06:40.416 --> 00:06:42.791
experiences life.

132
00:06:42.791 --> 00:06:47.333
That part belongs entirely to them.

133
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.000
Just as prakriti

134
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.375
provides the body, senses, and circumstances,

135
00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:53.333
the soul chooses

136
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:54.083
how to engage

137
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:59.875
with those arrangements.

138
00:06:59.875 --> 00:07:02.375
Here is an interesting example,

139
00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:06.041
even when given the same gift,

140
00:07:06.041 --> 00:07:07.333
one child may feel grateful

141
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:08.375
and content,

142
00:07:08.375 --> 00:07:12.625
while another feels restless or dissatisfied.

143
00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:14.208
Why?

144
00:07:14.208 --> 00:07:17.125
Because their inner experience is shaped

145
00:07:17.125 --> 00:07:21.125
by their own mindset and their own choices.

146
00:07:21.125 --> 00:07:23.666
As the head of the family,

147
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:27.500
your work is to guide with love

148
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.125
and set an example of clarity.

149
00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:36.250
But remember, never take the burden

150
00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:40.833
of everyone's happiness onto
your own shoulders.

151
00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:43.333
Teach your family members

152
00:07:43.333 --> 00:07:47.583
to take responsibility for their own inner growth.

153
00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:50.250
When you stop trying to control

154
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.791
their experience

155
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:53.958
and instead

156
00:07:53.958 --> 00:07:57.041
empower them with wisdom,

157
00:07:57.041 --> 00:08:00.583
you build a home

158
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:04.041
where true understanding grows.

159
00:08:04.041 --> 00:08:08.666
Remember, the arrangement matters.

160
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:11.666
But how it is used wisely

161
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:13.458
is what determines

162
00:08:13.458 --> 00:08:16.833
the true beginning of life.

163
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:23.333
You know this well,

164
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:24.875
at the workplace, things

165
00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:27.791
do not always go according to plan.

166
00:08:27.791 --> 00:08:30.750
Meetings get delayed,

167
00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.458
team members miss deadlines,

168
00:08:34.458 --> 00:08:36.458
clients change direction,

169
00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:39.750
and your day can go wrong quickly.

170
00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:43.125
Naturally, frustration, disappointment,

171
00:08:43.125 --> 00:08:45.791
or anxiety arise.

172
00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:48.750
But reflect on this,

173
00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.333
even though

174
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:54.166
you cannot control every situation,

175
00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:58.458
you can certainly control

176
00:08:58.458 --> 00:09:02.375
how you experience these setbacks.

177
00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:06.000
According to the Gita, material nature

178
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.291
creates external circumstances,

179
00:09:09.291 --> 00:09:12.333
workplace culture, deadlines,

180
00:09:12.333 --> 00:09:13.166
traffic jams,

181
00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:18.083
or systems breaking down.

182
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:20.500
But how you experience those moments?

183
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:24.500
That you decide.

184
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.333
You, the purusha, the soul.

185
00:09:28.333 --> 00:09:29.500
Your response

186
00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.041
does not arise from the situation.

187
00:09:32.041 --> 00:09:35.666
You choose it yourself.

188
00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:37.500
When you take personal responsibility

189
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.708
for your emotions,

190
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:42.333
you stop saying

191
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:44.125
'They made me angry'

192
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:47.666
or 'This situation ruined my day.'

193
00:09:47.666 --> 00:09:50.375
You begin to ask,

194
00:09:50.375 --> 00:09:53.750
'Why am I reacting this way?'

195
00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:57.625
And 'Is there another way to see this?'

196
00:09:57.625 --> 00:09:59.208
If your peace

197
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:01.666
depends only on things going

198
00:10:01.666 --> 00:10:03.250
your way,

199
00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.208
you will always be troubled.

200
00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:07.291
But if

201
00:10:07.291 --> 00:10:11.750
you ground yourself in your higher nature,

202
00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.041
knowing

203
00:10:13.041 --> 00:10:14.208
you are not defined

204
00:10:14.208 --> 00:10:17.333
by success or failure,

205
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:20.208
you remain balanced.

206
00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:23.958
Respond from awareness, not from impulse.

207
00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:25.333
Rest assured,

208
00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:29.000
then you will find both peace and strength

209
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.791
in your work.

210
00:10:30.791 --> 00:10:33.000
Whatever the circumstances may be,

211
00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.291
if the soul has mastered peace,

212
00:10:36.291 --> 00:10:39.375
there will be no distress, no suffering,

213
00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:41.166
no restlessness.
